                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On this #JewishDayofAction I met with @NCJW NY. I am proud they are standing with me as we fight against the Big Ugly Law that will kick millions of people off their health insurance, shut down hospitals across the country, and raise costs for Americans.\n \nI will continue to do everything I can until we repeal this dangerous law and protect Americans. #WeWillNotStandby",
