                "reply_count": 16,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I hosted a round table with @ProtectOurCare, @LegalAidNYC, and @MountSinaiNYC to discuss the GOP\u2019s Big Ugly Law that rips away healthcare for millions of Americans and funds tax breaks for billionaires.  \n\nI will continue fighting to repeal this terrible law and protect the healthcare of Americans across the country.",
